    "text": "By Natalie Dattilio ,\n6 hours ago KANSAS CITY, Mo. (KCTV) - An Independence man is heading to prison nearly 6 years after a fatal shooting in Leavenworth County. Joshua X. Craig, 24, was sentenced to 122 months, or over 10 years, in prison for voluntary manslaughter. He was convicted on June 29th. According to court records,... Read full article\n1",
